# Keeps the build context small and secret-free.
#
# IMPORTANT: do NOT exclude docker-compose.yaml or balena.yml. `balena push`
# applies these rules when tarring the project, not just when building an image,
# so excluding the compose file makes the builder see a bare Dockerfile. balena
# then deploys it as a single service named `main` - silently dropping the
# volume mount and every other service. Symptom: photos vanish on each release
# because the app is writing to the container layer instead of the volume, and
# the log prefix changes from `digital_frame` to `main`.
.git
target
synced_photos

# Local secrets must never enter a build context.
.env

# Docs / CI / editor cruft
.github
.claude
IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md
REQUIREMENTS.md
